        "Id1": {
            "text": "The construction of Alan B. Miller Hall lasted from March 30th, 2007 to June 1st, 2009. Robert A. M. Stern designed the building. Alan B. Miller Hall is located at 101 Ukrop Way, and the current tenant is the Mason School of Business, which is located in the United States."
